window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>At the prestigious Mearin Battle College, Nyathera strives to harness her self doubts and become a formidable warrior. Amidst rigorous training, she unexpectedly falls for the charming and brave trainee. Their love blossoms under the weight of their trials, but just as Nyathera begins to dream of a future together, betrayal shatters her world.</p> <p></p> <p>Cast into the City of Shadows and Nightmares—a dark realm once dismissed as a mere fairytale—Nyathera discovers the truth of her lineage. Will she embrace her destiny or will the scars of betrayal keep her from unlocking her true potential? In a tale of love, magic, and the fight for her own fate, Nyathera stands at the edge of a choice that could change everything.</p>"; 
